{"3395280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DINO FARM: Adventures in Jurassic Secrets ", "steam_appid": 3395280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/606c12b81a80e21082baeb0d4c26f47f.poster.avif?t=1773611077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/606c12b81a80e21082baeb0d4c26f47f.webm?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/606c12b81a80e21082baeb0d4c26f47f.mp4?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure tamagotchi game where you care for dinosaurs, collect them, and become a true paleontologist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/4c995190a262d20eba87ba18b80dac40.poster.avif?t=1773611077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/4c995190a262d20eba87ba18b80dac40.webm?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/4c995190a262d20eba87ba18b80dac40.mp4?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise dinosaurs: feed, wash, and play with them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your park and collect every dinosaur in the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather bones and use a miracle machine to turn them into eggs. Watch as baby dinosaurs hatch, nurture them, and take them on expeditions!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/411b82d4c6ac3ce6e1c6647c29158551.poster.avif?t=1773611077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/411b82d4c6ac3ce6e1c6647c29158551.webm?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/411b82d4c6ac3ce6e1c6647c29158551.mp4?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride dinosaurs! Choose from speedy, headbutting, long-necked, swimming, or flying dinosaurs to unlock new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build enclosures where dinosaurs can play together, becoming happier and stronger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/1e9db7aa02d3fbd22780eb4b7cf5966e.poster.avif?t=1773611077\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/1e9db7aa02d3fbd22780eb4b7cf5966e.webm?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/1e9db7aa02d3fbd22780eb4b7cf5966e.mp4?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute cartoon graphics and relaxing gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4-player co-op for family and friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration, construction, and decorating elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Educational aspects for dinosaur and history enthusiasts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/14b836015958809c6c11e22ef4193ef2.poster.avif?t=1773611077\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/14b836015958809c6c11e22ef4193ef2.webm?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/14b836015958809c6c11e22ef4193ef2.mp4?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting:</strong> an alternative future where you are an idealistic hikikomori downshifter dreaming of raising dinosaurs, while the main villain, a corporate leader, seeks to profit from these ancient creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/606c12b81a80e21082baeb0d4c26f47f.poster.avif?t=1773611077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/606c12b81a80e21082baeb0d4c26f47f.webm?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/606c12b81a80e21082baeb0d4c26f47f.mp4?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure tamagotchi game where you care for dinosaurs, collect them, and become a true paleontologist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/4c995190a262d20eba87ba18b80dac40.poster.avif?t=1773611077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/4c995190a262d20eba87ba18b80dac40.webm?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/4c995190a262d20eba87ba18b80dac40.mp4?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise dinosaurs: feed, wash, and play with them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your park and collect every dinosaur in the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather bones and use a miracle machine to turn them into eggs. Watch as baby dinosaurs hatch, nurture them, and take them on expeditions!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/411b82d4c6ac3ce6e1c6647c29158551.poster.avif?t=1773611077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/411b82d4c6ac3ce6e1c6647c29158551.webm?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/411b82d4c6ac3ce6e1c6647c29158551.mp4?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride dinosaurs! Choose from speedy, headbutting, long-necked, swimming, or flying dinosaurs to unlock new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build enclosures where dinosaurs can play together, becoming happier and stronger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/1e9db7aa02d3fbd22780eb4b7cf5966e.poster.avif?t=1773611077\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/1e9db7aa02d3fbd22780eb4b7cf5966e.webm?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/1e9db7aa02d3fbd22780eb4b7cf5966e.mp4?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute cartoon graphics and relaxing gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4-player co-op for family and friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration, construction, and decorating elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Educational aspects for dinosaur and history enthusiasts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/14b836015958809c6c11e22ef4193ef2.poster.avif?t=1773611077\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/14b836015958809c6c11e22ef4193ef2.webm?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395280/extras/14b836015958809c6c11e22ef4193ef2.mp4?t=1773611077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting:</strong> an alternative future where you are an idealistic hikikomori downshifter dreaming of raising dinosaurs, while the main villain, a corporate leader, seeks to profit from these ancient creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Adventure-Tamagotchi: care for dinosaurs 🦖🦕, collect them🥚 🦴 🌋🏺 and become a real paleontologist 🧭🏺💎! Grow your dinos, take care of them: feed, wash, play with them! Buil